    <exercise number="118" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Maxim has been offered positions by two car dealers. The first company pays a salary of \$10,000 plus a commission of \$1,000 for each car sold. The second pays a salary of \$20,000 plus a commission of \$500 for each car sold. How many cars would need to be sold to make the total pay the same?</paragraph>
